 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out, but the incident list showed it had been created anyway. I didn't resend it, so there's only one incident and one page to on-call. It covers the bad deploy, the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current state.\n\nTwo things still need follow-up, and both are noted in the incident: finding out why v2.3.1 failed (its release candidate was also unhealthy), and the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}